# Test: enum_value_added_request

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /orders:
    post:
      operationId: createOrder
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                status:
                  type: string
                  enum:
                    - pending
                    - processing
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /orders:
    post:
      operationId: createOrder
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                status:
                  type: string
                  enum:
                    - pending
                    - processing
                    - shipped
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createOrder()`: 
  *  `request.status.enum(shipped)` **Added**

## Full Mode:
